note """inference arm: a fan-in whose inputs carry the SAME type. Distinctness is types.Identical, so two edges of one identity are one identity and the join stays silent. This is the accepting control for the disagreeing fan-in."""
import "example.com/inference/subject/orderpkg/v2"

flow same
source ingest orders.Listen[orders.Order](":8080")
transform first orders.Score from ingest
transform second orders.Score from ingest
sink out orders.Store from first, second
